<< /A 38 0 R /Alt (Infographic illustrating an AI-driven ecosystem for personalized infection management with six steps: multimodal data acquisition, AI decision support, precision therapy modules, clinical implementation, outcome monitoring, and continuous optimization. Flow arrows connect each step, highlighting data types, integration, therapeutic options like phage and CRISPR, monitoring outcomes, and adaptive feedback loops. Foundational principles include precision, personalization, adaptability, ecological stewardship, One Health integration, and safety. Flow key explains arrow meanings.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
